  "spectral": {
    "true_color": "High confidence: water is very dark blue-green, vegetation is muted green to olive-brown, and narrow shoreline surfaces are pale gray-green. Land interiors are mottled, while most water is relatively smooth. No extensive bright sediment plume is visible; high confidence.",
